  "title": "Path ops",
  "description": "One item per path op, each with a reference computed analytically in the tests: a trim of a 100 u then 300 u polyline, rounded corners, an offset outline, a zig zag of 5 ridges, a bloat, a twist about a star's centre and a repeater of three copies.",
